Not kept: `fuzz 600 37 text` case 3 (extra_indic/deva2.png, lowcontrast) has no single right answer: the original
runs its symbol manipulators in absl flat_hash_map order (FunctionRegistry::GetAll), which is seeded per process,
and on that line Bengali and Devanagari marks make the order matter, so separate runs of the original give either
of two outputs. Ours gives the one the original gives with ASLR off (e.g. under lldb).
Stage dumps of the original: ../stages_extra_fuzz/. Excluded from the fuzz source images, so seeds stay
reproducible.
